<DocsExample TExample="SvgIconBasicExample" Title="Custom SVG icons" Description="NTSVGIcon renders trusted SVG markup at 1em, so it scales with font-size and inherits currentColor unless the SVG sets its own fill or stroke." />
<DocsExample TExample="SvgIconButtonExample" Title="SVG icons in other components" Description="NTSVGIcon is a NTIcon, so it can be passed anywhere a component accepts an icon. The host sizes and colors it like a Material Symbol." />
